    "html": "<html lang=\"en\"><head><script type=\"text/javascript\" async=\"\" src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-14NWFE7R74&amp;cx=c&amp;_slc=1\"></script><script type=\"text/javascript\" async=\"\" src=\"https://www.google-analytics.com/analytics.js\"></script><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id=GTM-MX6DBN9\" async=\"async\"></script><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/static/hash-c2rqmlh2/js/gtm.js\"></script><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, height=device-height, initial-scale=1, user-scalable=no\"><meta name=\"generator\" content=\"made with love by dartdoc\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"zaincash_payment library API docs, for the Dart programming language.\"><title>zaincash_payment library - Dart API</title><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://pub.dev/documentation/zaincash_payment/latest/zaincash_payment\"><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto+Mono:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,700;1,400&amp;display=swap\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@24,400,0,0\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/hash-c2rqmlh2/css/dartdoc.css\"><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?hash=nk4nss8c7444fg0chird9erqef2vkhb8\"></head><body class=\"light-theme\" data-base-href=\"../\" data-using-base-href=\"false\"><noscript><iframe class=\"-gtm-iframe\" src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-MX6DBN9\" height=\"0\" width=\"0\"></iframe></noscript><script src=\"/static/hash-c2rqmlh2/js/dark-init.js\"></script><div id=\"overlay-under-drawer\"></div><header id=\"title\"><span id=\"sidenav-left-toggle\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">menu</span><a class=\"hidden-xs\" href=\"/\"><img class=\"-dart-logo-img\" src=\"/static/hash-c2rqmlh2/img/dart-logo.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Go to the landing page of pub.dev\"></a><ol class=\"breadcrumbs gt-separated dark hidden-xs\"><li><a href=\"/packages/zaincash_payment\">zaincash_payment package</a></li><li><a href=\"../index.html\">documentation</a></li><li class=\"self-crumb\">zaincash_payment.dart</li></ol><div class=\"self-name\">zaincash_payment.dart</div><form class=\"search navbar-right\" role=\"search\"><div class=\"tt-wrapper\"><input id=\"search-box\" class=\"form-control typeahead tt-input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search API Docs\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"><div role=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"tt-menu\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"enter-search-message\"></div><div class=\"tt-search-results\"></div></div></div></form><button id=\"theme-button\" class=\"toggle\" aria-label=\"Light and dark mode toggle\" title=\"Toggle between light and dark mode\"><span id=\"dark-theme-button\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" aria-hidden=\"true\">dark_mode</span><span id=\"light-theme-button\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" aria-hidden=\"true\">light_mode</span></button></header><main><div id=\"dartdoc-main-content\" class=\"main-content\" data-above-sidebar=\"\" data-below-sidebar=\"zaincash_payment/zaincash_payment-library-sidebar.html\">\n  \n    <div>\n      \n\n      <h1>\n        <span class=\"kind-library\">zaincash_payment</span>\n        library \n \n\n      </h1>\n    </div>\n\n    \n<div class=\"desc markdown markdown-body\">\n  <p>A Flutter merchant gateway for the ZainCash Payment Gateway API v2\n(<a href=\"https://docs.zaincash.iq\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">https://docs.zaincash.iq</a>).</p>\n<p>Provides OAuth2 authentication, transaction creation/inquiry/reversal,\na ready-to-use WebView payment screen, and callback token decoding.</p>\n<p>For old-style merchant accounts (merchantId + JWT secret on\n<code>api.zaincash.iq</code>), import\n<code>package:zaincash_payment/zaincash_payment_legacy.dart</code> instead.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n    <div class=\"summary offset-anchor\" id=\"classes\">\n      <h2>Classes</h2>\n      <dl>\n          <dt id=\"ZainCashCallbackEvent\">\n  <span class=\"name \"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashCallbackEvent-class.html\">ZainCashCallbackEvent</a></span> \n\n</dt>\n<dd>\n  Decoded payload of the JWT token ZainCash appends to your\n<code>successUrl</code>/<code>failureUrl</code> (and sends to your webhook).\n</dd>\n\n          <dt id=\"ZainCashConfig\">\n  <span class=\"name \"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashConfig-class.html\">ZainCashConfig</a></span> \n\n</dt>\n<dd>\n  Merchant credentials and environment settings for the ZainCash\nPayment Gateway API v2 (<a href=\"https://docs.zaincash.iq\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">https://docs.zaincash.iq</a>).\n</dd>\n\n          <dt id=\"ZainCashPayment\">\n  <span class=\"name \"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashPayment-class.html\">ZainCashPayment</a></span> \n\n</dt>\n<dd>\n  Entry point helpers for starting a ZainCash payment.\n</dd>\n\n          <dt id=\"ZainCashPaymentPage\">\n  <span class=\"name \"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashPaymentPage-class.html\">ZainCashPaymentPage</a></span> \n\n</dt>\n<dd>\n  A full-screen WebView that drives a ZainCash v2 payment to completion.\n</dd>\n\n          <dt id=\"ZainCashPaymentRequest\">\n  <span class=\"name \"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashPaymentRequest-class.html\">ZainCashPaymentRequest</a></span> \n\n</dt>\n<dd>\n  Describes a payment to be created with the ZainCash Payment Gateway v2.\n</dd>\n\n          <dt id=\"ZainCashPaymentResult\">\n  <span class=\"name \"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashPaymentResult-class.html\">ZainCashPaymentResult</a></span> \n\n</dt>\n<dd>\n  Outcome of a payment driven by <code>ZainCashPaymentPage</code>.\n</dd>\n\n          <dt id=\"ZainCashPaymentSession\">\n  <span class=\"name \"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashPaymentSession-class.html\">ZainCashPaymentSession</a></span> \n\n</dt>\n<dd>\n  Result of creating a payment\n(<code>POST /api/v2/payment-gateway/transaction/init</code>).\n</dd>\n\n          <dt id=\"ZainCashReversalResult\">\n  <span class=\"name \"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashReversalResult-class.html\">ZainCashReversalResult</a></span> \n\n</dt>\n<dd>\n  Result of reversing (refunding) a transaction\n(<code>POST /api/v2/payment-gateway/transaction/reverse</code>).\n</dd>\n\n          <dt id=\"ZainCashService\">\n  <span class=\"name \"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashService-class.html\">ZainCashService</a></span> \n\n</dt>\n<dd>\n  Client for the ZainCash Payment Gateway API v2\n(<a href=\"https://docs.zaincash.iq\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">https://docs.zaincash.iq</a>).\n</dd>\n\n          <dt id=\"ZainCashTransactionDetails\">\n  <span class=\"name \"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashTransactionDetails-class.html\">ZainCashTransactionDetails</a></span> \n\n</dt>\n<dd>\n  Transaction details returned by the inquiry endpoint\n(<code>GET /api/v2/payment-gateway/transaction/inquiry/{transactionId}</code>).\n</dd>\n\n      </dl>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"summary offset-anchor\" id=\"enums\">\n      <h2>Enums</h2>\n      <dl>\n          <dt id=\"ZainCashErrorType\">\n  <span class=\"name \"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashErrorType.html\">ZainCashErrorType</a></span> \n\n</dt>\n<dd>\n  Categories of failures that can occur during a ZainCash flow.\n</dd>\n\n          <dt id=\"ZainCashLang\">\n  <span class=\"name \"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashLang.html\">ZainCashLang</a></span> \n\n</dt>\n<dd>\n  Supported interface languages for the ZainCash payment page.\n</dd>\n\n          <dt id=\"ZainCashTransactionStatus\">\n  <span class=\"name \"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashTransactionStatus.html\">ZainCashTransactionStatus</a></span> \n\n</dt>\n<dd>\n  Lifecycle status of a ZainCash Payment Gateway v2 transaction.\n</dd>\n\n      </dl>\n    </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"summary offset-anchor\" id=\"exceptions\">\n      <h2>Exceptions / Errors</h2>\n      <dl>\n          <dt id=\"ZainCashException\">\n  <span class=\"name \"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashException-class.html\">ZainCashException</a></span> \n\n</dt>\n<dd>\n  Error thrown by the ZainCash gateway.\n</dd>\n\n      </dl>\n    </div>\n  </div><div id=\"dartdoc-sidebar-left\" class=\"sidebar sidebar-offcanvas-left\"><header id=\"header-search-sidebar\" class=\"hidden-l\"><form class=\"search-sidebar\" role=\"search\"><div class=\"tt-wrapper\"><input id=\"search-sidebar\" class=\"form-control typeahead tt-input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search API Docs\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"><div role=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"tt-menu\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"enter-search-message\"></div><div class=\"tt-search-results\"></div></div></div></form></header><ol id=\"sidebar-nav\" class=\"breadcrumbs gt-separated dark hidden-l\"><li><a href=\"/packages/zaincash_payment\">zaincash_payment package</a></li><li><a href=\"../index.html\">documentation</a></li><li class=\"self-crumb\">zaincash_payment.dart</li></ol>\n    <!-- The search input and breadcrumbs below are only responsively visible at low resolutions. -->\n\n\n\n    <h5><span class=\"package-name\">zaincash_payment</span> <span class=\"package-kind\">package</span></h5>\n    <ol>\n      <li class=\"section-title\">Libraries</li>\n      <li><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/\">zaincash_payment</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"../zaincash_payment_legacy/\">zaincash_payment_legacy</a></li>\n</ol>\n\n  </div><div id=\"dartdoc-sidebar-right\" class=\"sidebar sidebar-offcanvas-right\">\n    <h5>zaincash_payment library</h5>\n  <div><ol>\n      <li class=\"section-title\"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/#classes\">Classes</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashCallbackEvent-class.html\">ZainCashCallbackEvent</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashConfig-class.html\">ZainCashConfig</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashPayment-class.html\">ZainCashPayment</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashPaymentPage-class.html\">ZainCashPaymentPage</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashPaymentRequest-class.html\">ZainCashPaymentRequest</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashPaymentResult-class.html\">ZainCashPaymentResult</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashPaymentSession-class.html\">ZainCashPaymentSession</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashReversalResult-class.html\">ZainCashReversalResult</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashService-class.html\">ZainCashService</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashTransactionDetails-class.html\">ZainCashTransactionDetails</a></li>\n\n      <li class=\"section-title\"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/#enums\">Enums</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashErrorType.html\">ZainCashErrorType</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashLang.html\">ZainCashLang</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashTransactionStatus.html\">ZainCashTransactionStatus</a></li>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n      <li class=\"section-title\"><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/#exceptions\">Exceptions</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"../zaincash_payment/ZainCashException-class.html\">ZainCashException</a></li>\n\n</ol>\n</div></div></main><footer><span class=\"no-break\">zaincash_payment 0.0.1</span></footer><script src=\"/static/hash-c2rqmlh2/dartdoc/resources/highlight.pack.js\"></script><script src=\"/static/hash-c2rqmlh2/dartdoc/resources/docs.dart.js\"></script></body></html>",
